@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@csrf = COPY_csrfToken_FROM_SESSION
@email = developer@example.com
@password = Development-Password-42!
@userId = COPY_FROM_CONFIRMATION_EMAIL
@token = COPY_FROM_EMAIL

### Use a client cookie jar. Fetch a new token after login/logout and before mutations.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### Register (generic response; inspect development App_Data/mail for .eml)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Verify the confirmation link explicitly (GET links never mutate accounts)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/confirm-email
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"userId":"{{userId}}","token":"{{token}}"}

### Sign in
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Sign out
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{}

### Request password reset (generic response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"email":"{{email}}"}

### Reset (token is single-use)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"email":"{{email}}","token":"{{token}}","password":"New-Development-Password-42!"}

### Resend verification (generic response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/resend-confirmation
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"email":"{{email}}"}

### Change password. Google-only users omit currentPassword after fresh Google sign-in.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/password
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"currentPassword":"{{password}}","newPassword":"New-Development-Password-42!"}

### Google login (404 when disabled). Navigate the browser to the returned local URL.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/google/start
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"mode":"login"}

### Link Google (signed in; current password required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/google/start
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"mode":"link","password":"{{password}}"}

### Google challenge (state URL and matching HttpOnly cookie issued by start)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/google/challenge?state=COPY_FROM_START_URL

### Callback is normally reached only after the provider middleware validates OAuth state.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/google/callback

### Unlink (requires a current password; cannot remove the last authentication method)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/google/unlink
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"password":"{{password}}"}

### Error: missing CSRF is rejected, even for login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"incorrect"}
